      "writtenOn": "2026-08-28T23:49:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the original code using int16 works on all platforms and is simplier... this is an overzealous build option.\nnever the less, if we dont mind potentially slower code, i would treat \u0027uv\u0027 as 2 channel int8 and do the code the same as argb does or rgb will, which is unroll 8 bit loads in the function.  an additional function call to do it doesnt add value, and in this case breaks the intent, which is endian sensitive int16.",
      "parentUuid": "e64dadfa_b9a5cb01",
      "revId": "679655dfc53f6120c437a8631bae44452eb2b903",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
